      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brucetown%2C_Virginia",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "During the French and Indian War, Mary Littler ran the Blue Ball Inn near the village, hosting officers of the 44th British Regiment.",
